#: index.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>zstd</command> is a compression program."
msgstr ""

# automatic translation
#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The zstd KIO worker is not directly usable, and is intended for use as a "
"filter. For example, the tar KIO worker can filter a file through the zstd "
"KIO worker, in order to display the contents of a <literal "
"role=\"extension\">tar.zst</literal> file directly in a &konqueror; window."
msgstr ""

# automatic translation
#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you click on a file compressed with a <literal "
"role=\"extension\">zst</literal> extension in &konqueror;, this KIO worker "
"is used to uncompress it and display it as a normal (uncompressed) file."
msgstr ""

# automatic translation
#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, and would like to use the zstd filter, you can find "
"documentation on using KIO workers at <ulink "
"url=\"http://techbase.kde.org\">http://techbase.kde.org</ulink>"
msgstr ""

# automatic translation
#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "See the manual: <ulink url=\"man:/zstd\">zstd</ulink>."
msgstr ""
